WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.064
The GROUP BY versus PARTITION BY choice is
fundamentally a grain decision If

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:11.814
you want one row per patient GROUP BY may be correct
If you need every

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:17.606
admission and the patient average beside it a window
is a better fit Ask

00:00:17.632 --> 00:00:20.119
whether detail should be collapsed or preserved
